msgid "Energy gradients"
msgstr "能量梯度"

msgid "Analytical energy gradients"
msgstr "解析能量梯度"

msgid "Molpro uses different gradient programs:"
msgstr "Molpro 使用不同的梯度程序："

msgid ""
"The ``Cadpac`` gradient program is based on the ``Cadpac`` integral routines"
" by R. D. Amos. Currently, this program works for closed shell SCF, high "
"spin RHF, and (state averaged) MCSCF. In the MCSCF case the wavefunction "
"must either be fully optimized, or frozen core orbitals must be taken from a"
" closed-shell SCF calculation (but this does not work in the case of state-"
"averaged MCSCF). Note that ``Cadpac`` does not work with generally "
"contracted basis functions."
msgstr ""
"``Cadpac`` 梯度程序基于 R. D. Amos 的 ``Cadpac`` 积分程序。目前，该程序适用于闭壳层 SCF、高自旋 RHF "
"以及（态平均）MCSCF。对于 MCSCF 情况，波函数必须完全优化，或者冻结芯轨道必须取自闭壳层 SCF 计算（但这在态平均 MCSCF "
"情况下无效）。请注意，\\ ``Cadpac`` 不适用于广义收缩基函数。"

msgid ""
"The ``Alaska`` gradient program is based on the ``Seward`` integral routines"
" by R. Lindh. It allows the calculation of gradients of generally contracted"
" basis functions for closed or open shell RHF, UHF, RKS, UKS, MCSCF, RS2 "
"(CASPT2), local PAO-RMP2, and for closed shell MP2, LMP2, DF-LMP2, QCISD, "
"QCISD(T), CCSD, DCSD, CCSD(T). Gradients for state averaged MCSCF wave "
"functions can be evaluated using the RS2 gradient program, see section "
"`State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Seward <energy_gradients.html#state-"
"averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-seward>`__. For details about CASPT2 "
"gradients, see section `CASPT2 gradients "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__."
msgstr ""
"``Alaska`` 梯度程序基于 R. Lindh 的 ``Seward`` 积分程序。它允许计算闭壳层或开壳层 "
"RHF、UHF、RKS、UKS、MCSCF、RS2 (CASPT2)、局域 PAO-RMP2 以及闭壳层 MP2、LMP2、DF-"
"LMP2、QCISD、QCISD(T)、CCSD、DCSD、CCSD(T) 的广义收缩基函数梯度。态平均 MCSCF 波函数的梯度可以使用 RS2 "
"梯度程序进行评估，参见章节 `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Seward "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-seward>`__\\ 。有关 "
"CASPT2 梯度的详细信息，请参见章节 `CASPT2 gradients "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"The ``AIC`` density fitting integral program written by G. Knizia computes "
"two- and three-index integrals and integral derivatives. This program is "
"used for computing gradients for the DF-MP2, DF-LMP2, DF-CCSD, DF-CCSD(T), "
"DF-MP2-F12, DF-CCSD-F12, DF-CCSD(T)-F12, state averaged DF-MCSCF, and DF-"
"CASPT2 methods."
msgstr ""
"由 G. Knizia 编写的 ``AIC`` 密度拟合积分程序计算二指标和三指标积分及其导数。该程序用于计算 DF-MP2、DF-LMP2、DF-"
"CCSD、DF-CCSD(T)、DF-MP2-F12、DF-CCSD-F12、DF-CCSD(T)-F12、态平均 DF-MCSCF 和 DF-"
"CASPT2 方法的梯度。"

msgid ""
"By default, the program uses ``Alaska`` gradients whenever possible. "
"However, it is possible to force the use of a particular gradient program by"
" defining the variable ``GRADTYP`` before calling the gradient program:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序尽可能使用 ``Alaska`` 梯度。但是，可以通过在调用梯度程序之前定义变量 ``GRADTYP`` 来强制使用特定的梯度程序："

msgid "The gradient program is called using the ``FORCE`` command:"
msgstr "梯度程序使用 ``FORCE`` 命令调用："

msgid "``FORCE``"
msgstr "``FORCE``"

msgid ""
"Normally, the ``FORCE`` command is not needed, since geometry optimizations "
"should be performed using the ``OPTG`` procedure. An exception is the "
"optimization of counterpoise corrected energies, which requires several "
"force calculations (cf. section `optimizing counterpoise corrected energies "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-corrected-"
"energies>`__)."
msgstr ""
"通常不需要 ``FORCE`` 命令，因为几何优化应使用 ``OPTG`` 过程执行。一个例外是优化基组重叠校正能量，这需要多次力计算（参见 "
"`优化基组重叠校正能量 <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-"
"corrected-energies>`__ 一节）。"

msgid ""
"The ``FORCE`` command must be given after the energy calculation to which it"
" refers. If the command for the energy calculation (e.g. ``HF``, ``KS``, "
"``MP2``, etc.) is in a procedure, the ``FORCE`` must also be in the "
"procedure. Furthermore, no procedures without an energy calculation must "
"directly precede ``FORCE``."
msgstr ""
"``FORCE`` 命令必须放在其引用的能量计算之后。如果能量计算的命令（例如 ``HF``\\ 、\\ ``KS``\\ 、\\ ``MP2`` "
"等）在某个过程中，则 ``FORCE`` 也必须在该过程中。此外，没有能量计算的过程不能直接位于 ``FORCE`` 之前。"

msgid ""
"If no further data cards are given, the default is to evaluate the gradient "
"for the last optimized wavefunction. In this case no further input is needed"
" for ordinary gradient cases (the program remembers the records on which the"
" wavefunction information is stored). An exception is the unusual case that "
"several different ``CPMCSCF`` calculations have been formed in a previous "
"MCSCF calculation. In this case the ``SAMC`` directive must be used to "
"select the desired record. If analytical gradients are not available for the"
" last wavefunction, the gradient is computed numerically. For more details "
"regarding numerical energy gradients see section `numerical gradients "
"<energy_gradients.html#numerical-gradients>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果没有提供其他数据卡，默认是评估最后一个优化波函数的梯度。对于普通的梯度情况，此时不需要进一步的输入（程序会记住存储波函数信息的记录）。一个例外情况是，在之前的"
" MCSCF 计算中形成了多个不同的 ``CPMCSCF`` 计算。在这种情况下，必须使用 ``SAMC`` "
"指令来选择所需的记录。如果最后一个波函数没有解析梯度可用，则梯度将通过数值方法计算。有关数值能量梯度的更多详细信息，请参阅 `数值梯度 "
"<energy_gradients.html#numerical-gradients>`__ 一节。"

msgid "Adding gradients (ADD)"
msgstr "梯度相加 (ADD)"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the current gradient and energy are added to the "
"previous ones using the given factor. This is useful for the optimization of"
" counterpoise corrected energies (cf. `optimizing counterpoise corrected "
"energies <geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-corrected-"
"energies>`__). By default, the program will stop with an error message "
"unless ``NOORIENT`` has been specified in the geometry input. This behaviour"
" can be disabled by the ``NOCHECK`` option. This option should only be given"
" if all gradients which are added are evaluated at exactly the same nuclear "
"geometry; otherwise wrong results could result due to unintended rotations "
"of the system."
msgstr ""
"如果存在此卡片，则使用给定的因子将当前梯度和能量与之前的相加。这对于优化反式校正能量很有用（参见\\ `优化反式校正能量 "
"<optg.html#section>`__\\ ）。默认情况下，除非在几何输入中指定了\\ ``NOORIENT``\\ "
"，否则程序将停止并显示错误消息。此行为可以通过\\ ``NOCHECK``\\ "
"选项禁用。仅当所有被加的梯度都在完全相同的核几何结构下计算时，才应给出此选项；否则，由于系统的不期望旋转，可能导致错误结果。"

msgid "Scaling gradients (SCALE)"
msgstr "缩放梯度 (SCALE)"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the current gradient and energy are scaled by the "
"give factor. This is sometimes useful for the optimization of counterpoise "
"corrected energies (cf. `optimizing counterpoise corrected energies "
"<geometry_optimization_optg.html#optimizing-counterpoise-corrected-"
"energies>`__)."
msgstr ""
"如果存在此卡片，则当前梯度和能量按给定因子缩放。这对于优化反式校正能量有时很有用（参见\\ `优化反式校正能量 "
"<optg.html#section>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Defining the orbitals for SCF gradients (ORBITAL)"
msgstr "定义 SCF 梯度的轨道 (ORBITAL)"

msgid ""
"In the SCF case, *record.file* specifies the location of the orbitals, which"
" are used for constructing density matrices, etc. This card is only needed "
"if the SCF for which the gradient is to be computed was not the most recent "
"energy calculation."
msgstr "在 SCF 情况下，\\ *记录.文件* 指定了用于构建密度矩阵等的轨道位置。仅当要计算梯度的 SCF 不是最近的能量计算时，才需要此卡片。"

msgid ""
"For MCSCF wavefunctions, the ``ORBITAL`` card is not needed, because the "
"location of the orbitals is stored in the MCSCF dump record."
msgstr "对于 MCSCF 波函数，不需要\\ ``ORBITAL``\\ 卡片，因为轨道位置存储在 MCSCF 转储记录中。"

msgid "Using grid weight derivatives for DFT gradients (GRIDGRAD)"
msgstr "在 DFT 梯度计算中使用格点权重导数 (GRIDGRAD)"

msgid "``FORCE,GRIDGRAD``\\ =\\ *0 or 1*"
msgstr "``FORCE,GRIDGRAD``\\ =\\ *0 或 1*"

msgid ""
"Defines whether grid weight derivatives are included in analytical gradient "
"calculations (default: 0). Disabling these can improve convergence in "
"geometry optimizations."
msgstr "定义是否在解析梯度计算中包含格点权重导数（默认值：0）。禁用这些导数可以改善几何优化的收敛性。"

msgid "MCSCF gradients (MCSCF)"
msgstr "MCSCF 梯度 (MCSCF)"

msgid ""
"Triggers code for MCSCF gradient. *record.file* specifies the location of "
"information dumped from the MCSCF program, using a ``SAVE,GRD=``\\ "
"*recmc.filmc* card. This card is not needed if the ``FORCE`` command appears"
" directly after the corresponding MCSCF input, since the program "
"automatically remembers where the MCSCF information was stored. The same is "
"true if ``OPTG`` is used."
msgstr ""
"触发 MCSCF 梯度计算代码。\\ *record.file* 指定了从 MCSCF 程序转储的信息的位置，使用 ``SAVE,GRD=``\\ "
"*recmc.filmc* 卡片。如果 ``FORCE`` 命令直接出现在相应的 MCSCF 输入之后，则不需要此卡片，因为程序会自动记住 MCSCF "
"信息的存储位置。如果使用 ``OPTG`` 也是如此。"

msgid "State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Seward"
msgstr "使用 Seward 计算态平均 MCSCF 梯度"

msgid ""
"SA-MCSCF gradients can be computed using segmented or generally contracted "
"basis sets using ``Seward`` and the RS2 gradient program. The ``NOEXC`` "
"directive has to be used in the ``RS2`` input, but no ``CPMCSCF`` card is "
"required in ``MULTI``. The RS2 gradient program does the CP-MCSCF "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"SA-MCSCF 梯度可以使用分段或广义收缩基组，通过 ``Seward`` 和 RS2 梯度程序进行计算。必须在 ``RS2`` 输入中使用 "
"``NOEXC`` 指令，但在 ``MULTI`` 中不需要 ``CPMCSCF`` 卡片。RS2 梯度程序会自动执行 CP-MCSCF。"

msgid ""
"Example: compute SA-CASSCF gradients for :math:`^2\\Pi` and "
":math:`^2\\Sigma^+` state of OH."
msgstr "示例：计算 OH 分子 :math:`^2\\Pi` 和 :math:`^2\\Sigma^+` 态的 SA-CASSCF 梯度。"

msgid ""
"Without the ``NOEXC`` directive, the RS2 (CASPT2) gradient would be "
"evaluated, using the state-averaged orbitals."
msgstr "如果没有 ``NOEXC`` 指令，将使用态平均轨道计算 RS2 (CASPT2) 梯度。"

msgid "State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac"
msgstr "使用 Cadpac 的态平均 MCSCF 梯度"

msgid ""
"[sec:samcgrad2] Normally, no further input is required for computing "
"gradients for state-averaged MCSCF when ``Cadpac`` is used. Note, however, "
"that a ``CPMCSCF,GRAD``,\\ *state* directive is required in the SA-MCSCF "
"calculation (see Section `Coupled-perturbed MCSCF "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#coupled-perturbed-mcscf>`__). The gradients "
"are then computed automatically for the *state* specified on the ``CPMCSCF``"
" card. The same is true for difference gradients (``CPMCSCF,DGRAD``,\\ "
"*state1, state2*) and non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements "
"(``CPMCSCF,NACM``,\\ *state1, state2*). It is possible to do several "
"coupled-perturbed MCSCF calculations one after each other in the same MCSCF."
" In this case ``FORCE`` would use the last solution by default. The "
"information from the CPMCSCF is passed to the FORCE program in a certain "
"records (default 5101.1, 5102.1, …). If several CPMCSCF calculations are "
"performed in the same MCSCF, several such records may be present, and a "
"particular one can be accessed in the ``FORCE`` program using the ``SAMC`` "
"directive:"
msgstr ""
"[sec:samcgrad2] 通常，当使用 ``Cadpac`` 时，计算态平均 MCSCF 的梯度不需要额外的输入。但请注意，在 SA-MCSCF "
"计算中需要一个 ``CPMCSCF,GRAD``,\\ *state* 指令（参见 `Coupled-perturbed MCSCF "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#coupled-perturbed-mcscf>`__ 节）。然后，梯度将针对 "
"``CPMCSCF`` 卡片上指定的 *state* 自动计算。差分梯度（\\ ``CPMCSCF,DGRAD``,\\ *state1, "
"state2*\\ ）和非绝热耦合矩阵元（\\ ``CPMCSCF,NACM``,\\ *state1, state2*\\ ）也是如此。可以在同一个 "
"MCSCF 计算中连续进行多个耦合微扰 MCSCF 计算。在这种情况下，\\ ``FORCE`` 程序默认会使用最后一个解。来自 CPMCSCF "
"的信息通过特定的记录（默认为 5101.1, 5102.1, …）传递给 FORCE 程序。如果在同一个 MCSCF 中执行了多个 CPMCSCF "
"计算，则可能存在多个此类记录，并且可以在 ``FORCE`` 程序中使用 ``SAMC`` 指令访问特定的记录："

msgid ""
"An alias for ``SAMC`` is ``CPMC``. For compatibility with earlier versions "
"one can also use"
msgstr "``SAMC`` 的别名是 ``CPMC``\\ 。为了与早期版本兼容，也可以使用"

msgid "for non-adiabatic couplings or"
msgstr "用于非绝热耦合，或"

msgid "for difference gradients."
msgstr "用于差分梯度。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Non-adiabatic coupling matrix elements (NACM)"
msgstr "非绝热耦合矩阵元（NACM）"

msgid ""
"see Section `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-cadpac>`__."
msgstr ""
"参见章节 `State-averaged MCSCF gradients with Cadpac "
"<energy_gradients.html#state-averaged-mcscf-gradients-with-cadpac>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Difference gradients for SA-MCSCF (DEMC)"
msgstr "SA-MCSCF 的差分梯度（DEMC）"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Numerical gradients"
msgstr "数值梯度"

msgid ""
"[sec:numgrad] It is possible to compute gradients by finite differences "
"using"
msgstr "[sec:numgrad] 可以使用有限差分法计算梯度，通过"

msgid ""
"Numerical gradients are computed automatically if no analytical gradients "
"are available for the last energy calculation. By default, no further input "
"are needed, and the gradient will be computed for the last energy "
"calculation. The following options can be given on the ``FORCE`` command or "
"on subsequent directives (see subsequent sections):"
msgstr ""
"如果上一次能量计算没有可用的解析梯度，则会自动计算数值梯度。默认情况下，不需要进一步的输入，梯度将针对上一次能量计算进行计算。以下选项可以在 "
"``FORCE`` 命令或后续指令中给出（参见后续章节）："

msgid ""
"``COORD=ZMAT|CART|3N`` coordinates with respect to which the gradient is "
"evaluated. See section `choice of coordinates (COORD) "
"<energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-coord>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"``COORD=ZMAT|CART|3N`` 评估梯度所依据的坐标。更多信息请参见章节 `choice of coordinates (COORD) "
"<energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-coord>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SYMMETRY=AUTO|NOSYM`` Symmetry to be used in wavefunction calculations of "
"numerical gradients. This option is only relevant if "
"``DISPLACE=UNIQUE|CART``. If ``AUTO`` is given, the maximum possible "
"symmetry is used for each displacement. This implies that the energy is "
"independent of the symmetry used. Note that this often not the case in MRCI "
"or CASPT2 calculations. The option can also not be used in local correlation"
" calculations."
msgstr ""
"``SYMMETRY=AUTO|NOSYM`` 数值梯度波函数计算中使用的对称性。此选项仅在 ``DISPLACE=UNIQUE|CART`` "
"时相关。如果指定 ``AUTO``\\ ，则对每个位移使用最大可能的对称性。这意味着能量与所使用的对称性无关。请注意，在 MRCI 或 CASPT2 "
"计算中通常并非如此。此选项也不能用于局域相关计算。"

msgid "``AUTO`` (logical). Same as ``SYMMETRY=AUTO``"
msgstr "``AUTO`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``SYMMETRY=AUTO``"

msgid "``ZMAT`` (logical). Same as ``COORD=ZMAT``"
msgstr "``ZMAT`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``COORD=ZMAT``"

msgid "``OPT3N`` (logical). Same as ``COORD=3N``"
msgstr "``OPT3N`` (逻辑值)。等同于 ``COORD=3N``"

msgid ""
"``CENTRAL`` (logical). Use 2-point central formula; needs :math:`2M` energy "
"calculations for :math:`M` degrees of freedom."
msgstr "``CENTRAL`` (逻辑值)。使用 2 点中心差分公式；对于 :math:`M` 个自由度需要 :math:`2M` 次能量计算。"

msgid ""
"``FORWARD`` (logical). Use forward gradients (needs only :math:`M+1` energy "
"calculations, but less accurate)"
msgstr "``FORWARD`` (逻辑值)。使用前向梯度（仅需 :math:`M+1` 次能量计算，但精度较低）"

msgid ""
"``FOURPOINT`` (logical). Use 4-point formula for accurate numerical "
"gradient; needs :math:`4M` energy calculations."
msgstr "``FOURPOINT`` (逻辑值)。使用四点公式进行精确的数值梯度计算；需要 :math:`4M` 次能量计算。"

msgid ""
"``NUMERICAL`` (logical). Force the use of numerical gradients, even if "
"gradients are available."
msgstr "``NUMERICAL`` (逻辑值)。强制使用数值梯度，即使梯度可用。"

msgid ""
"``VARSAV`` (logical). Save gradient in variables ``GRADX``, ``GRADY``, "
"``GRADZ``."
msgstr "``VARSAV`` (逻辑值)。将梯度保存到变量 ``GRADX``\\ 、\\ ``GRADY``\\ 、\\ ``GRADZ`` 中。"

msgid ""
"The program will then automatically repeat ``HF`` and ``CCSD(T)`` at as many"
" geometries as needed for evaluating the gradient. This is equivalent to"
msgstr "程序随后将自动在评估梯度所需的多个几何结构下重复执行 ``HF`` 和 ``CCSD(T)`` 计算。这等价于"

msgid "or, using a procedure"
msgstr "或者，使用一个过程"

msgid "Choice of coordinates (COORD)"
msgstr "坐标选择 (COORD)"

msgid ""
"By default, the numerical gradients are computed relative to all variables "
"on which the z-matrix depends. If the z-matrix depends on no variables or on"
" :math:`3N` variables, the gradient is computed for all :math:`3N` "
"coordinates and symmetrical displacement coordinates are used to evaluate "
"the gradient. This yields the minimum computational effort."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，数值梯度是相对于 Z-矩阵所依赖的所有变量计算的。如果 Z-矩阵不依赖任何变量或依赖 :math:`3N` 个变量，则对所有 "
":math:`3N` 个坐标计算梯度，并使用对称位移坐标来评估梯度。这能实现最小的计算量。"

msgid "These defaults can be modified using the ``COORD`` directive:"
msgstr "可以使用 ``COORD`` 指令修改这些默认设置："

msgid "where *coord_type* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "其中 *coord_type* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``ZMAT`` Compute the numerical gradients for all variables on which the "
"geometry depends (default)."
msgstr "``ZMAT`` 计算几何结构所依赖的所有变量的数值梯度（默认）。"

msgid ""
"The specification of *displacement_type* is optional and only affects the "
"numerical calculation of the gradient for :math:`3N` coordinates. It can "
"also be given using"
msgstr "*displacement_type* 的指定是可选的，并且仅影响 :math:`3N` 坐标梯度的数值计算。它也可以通过以下方式给出"

msgid "*displacement_type* can be one of the following:"
msgstr "*displacement_type* 可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``SYM`` Use symmetrical displacements. This yields the minimum number of "
"displacements and always preserves the symmetry of the wavefunction. This is"
" the default and only recommended option."
msgstr "``SYM`` 使用对称位移。这会产生最少数量的位移，并且始终保留波函数的对称性。这是默认且唯一推荐的选项。"

msgid ""
"``CART`` Displacements are generated for all :math:`3N` Cartesian "
"coordinates. This is normally not recommended, since in cases in which "
"molecular symmetry is present it generates far more displacements than "
"needed. Also, the wavefunction symmetry is not preserved, and the "
"calculation must be done in C1 symmetry."
msgstr ""
"``CART`` 为所有 :math:`3N` "
"个笛卡尔坐标生成位移。通常不推荐此选项，因为在存在分子对称性的情况下，它会产生远多于所需的位移。此外，波函数对称性不被保留，计算必须在 C1 "
"对称性下进行。"

msgid ""
"``UNIQUE`` As ``CART``, but symmetry-equivalent displacements are "
"eliminated. Not recommended either."
msgstr "``UNIQUE`` 与 ``CART`` 类似，但消除了对称等价的位移。同样不推荐。"

msgid "Numerical derivatives of a variable"
msgstr "变量的数值导数"

msgid "Numerical derivatives of the value of a variable can be computed using"
msgstr "可以使用以下方式计算变量值的数值导数"

msgid "The default is to compute the gradient of the current energy."
msgstr "默认是计算当前能量的梯度。"

msgid "Step-sizes for numerical gradients"
msgstr "数值梯度的步长"

msgid ""
"By default, the numerical step sizes are 0.01 bohr for distances or "
"Cartesian coordinates, and 1 degree for angles. These defaults can be "
"changed using"
msgstr "默认情况下，数值步长对于距离或笛卡尔坐标为 0.01 玻尔，对于角度为 1 度。可以使用以下选项更改这些默认值："

msgid ""
"where *dr* is the displacement for distances (or Cartesian coordinates) in "
"bohr, and *da* is the displacement for angles in degree. The value of "
"``RSTEP`` is used for symmetrical displacements. The step sizes for "
"individual variables can be modified using"
msgstr ""
"其中 *dr* 是以玻尔为单位的距离（或笛卡尔坐标）位移，\\ *da* 是以度为单位的角位移。\\ ``RSTEP`` "
"的值用于对称位移。可以使用以下选项修改单个变量的步长："

msgid ""
"where the *value* must be in atomic units for distances and in degree for "
"angles."
msgstr "其中 *value* 对于距离必须使用原子单位，对于角度必须使用度。"

msgid "Active and inactive coordinates"
msgstr "活动与非活动坐标"

msgid ""
"By default, numerical gradients are computed with respect to all variables "
"on which the Z-matrix depends, or for all :math:`3N` coordinates if there "
"are no variables or ``XYZ`` inputstyle is used. One can define subsets of "
"active variables using"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，数值梯度是针对 Z-矩阵所依赖的所有变量计算的，或者如果没有变量或使用了 ``XYZ`` 输入样式，则针对所有 :math:`3N` "
"个坐标计算。可以使用以下选项定义活动变量的子集："

msgid "In this case all variables that are not given are active."
msgstr "在这种情况下，所有未给出的变量均为活性变量。"

msgid "Saving the gradient in a variables"
msgstr "将梯度保存在变量中"

msgid "If the directive"
msgstr "如果指令"

msgid "``VARSAV``"
msgstr "``VARSAV``"

msgid ""
"is given, the gradient is saved in variables ``GRADX``, ``GRADY``, "
"``GRADZ``. ``GRADX(n)`` is the derivative with respect to :math:`x` for the "
":math:`n`-th atom. The atoms are in the order as printed. This order can be "
"different from the order in the input z-matrix, since the centres are "
"reordered so that all atoms of the same type follow each other."
msgstr ""
"被给出，梯度将被保存在变量 ``GRADX``\\ 、\\ ``GRADY``\\ 、\\ ``GRADZ`` 中。\\ ``GRADX(n)`` 是第"
" :math:`n` 个原子关于 :math:`x` 的导数。原子的顺序与打印顺序一致。此顺序可能与输入 "
"Z-矩阵中的顺序不同，因为中心会被重新排序，使得所有相同类型的原子彼此相邻。"

msgid "``GRADTYP=ALASKA\\\\`` ``GRADTYP=CADPAC``"
msgstr "``GRADTYP=ALASKA\\\\`` ``GRADTYP=CADPAC``"

