msgid "``FORCE,NUMERICAL,options``"
msgstr "``FORCE,NUMERICAL,options``"

msgid ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *command*** The input between *command* and the current"
" ``FORCE`` command defines the energy calculation for which the gradient is "
"computed. This input section is executed for each displacement."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTCMD``\\ =\\ *\\ command*** 在 *\\ command* 与当前 ``FORCE`` "
"命令之间输入的内容定义了计算其梯度的能量计算。该输入段对每个位移执行一次。"

msgid ""
"**``PROC``\\ =\\ *procname*** specifies a procedure to be executed for each "
"displacement. This must define a complete energy calculation and must not "
"contain gradient or Hessian calculations."
msgstr ""
"**``PROC``\\ =\\ *\\ procname*** 指定对每个位移执行的过程。该过程必须定义完整的能量计算，且不得包含梯度或 "
"Hessian 计算。"

msgid ""
"**``VARIABLE``\\ =\\ *varname*** Compute the gradient of the value of "
"variable *varname*. This implies numerical gradients. The variable must be "
"set in the corresponding energy calculation."
msgstr ""
"**``VARIABLE``\\ =\\ *\\ varname*** 计算变量 *\\ varname* "
"值的梯度。这意味着使用数值梯度。该变量必须在相应的能量计算中设置。"

msgid "``DISPLACE=ZMAT|SYM|UNIQUE|CART``"
msgstr "``DISPLACE=ZMAT|SYM|UNIQUE|CART``"

msgid ""
"Displacement coordinates to be used for numerical gradient. The default is "
"``ZMAT`` if the geometry is given as a zmatrix which depends on variables, "
"and ``SYM`` (symmetrical displacement coordinates) otherwise. See section "
"`choice of coordinates (COORD) <energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-"
"coord>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"用于数值梯度的位移坐标。若几何结构以依赖变量的 zmatrix 形式给出，则默认为 ``ZMAT``\\ ，否则默认为 ``SYM``\\ "
"（对称位移坐标）。更多信息参见 `choice of coordinates (COORD) "
"<energy_gradients.html#choice-of-coordinates-coord>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``RSTEP``\\ =\\ *rstep*** Step length for distances in numerical gradient "
"calculations (in bohr). The default is 0.01."
msgstr "**``RSTEP``\\ =\\ *\\ rstep*** 数值梯度计算中距离的步长（单位为 bohr）。默认为 0.01。"

msgid ""
"**``DSTEP``\\ =\\ *dstep*** Step length for symmetrical displacements (in "
"bohr). The default is 0.01."
msgstr "**``DSTEP``\\ =\\ *\\ dstep*** 对称位移的步长（单位为 bohr）。默认为 0.01。"

msgid ""
"**``ASTEP``\\ =\\ *astep*** Step length for angles in numerical gradient "
"calculations (in degree). The default is 1."
msgstr "**``ASTEP``\\ =\\ *\\ astep*** 数值梯度计算中角度的步长（单位为度）。默认为 1。"

msgid "``COORD,coord_type,[displacement_type]``"
msgstr "``COORD,coord_type,[displacement_type]``"

msgid ""
"**``3N`` or ``CART``** Compute the gradients for all :math:`3N` nuclear "
"coordinates. This is the default if the z-matrix does not depend on "
"variables or if the ``xyz`` input format is used. If this option is used and"
" the original geometry is given in z-matrix form, the z-matrix is lost."
msgstr ""
"**``3N`` 或 ``CART``** 计算所有 :math:`3N` 个原子核坐标的梯度。若 z-matrix 不依赖变量或使用 ``xyz`` "
"输入格式，则此为默认值。若使用此选项且原始几何结构以 z-matrix 形式给出，则 z-matrix 将丢失。"

msgid "``DISPLACE,displacement_type``"
msgstr "``DISPLACE,displacement_type``"

msgid "``VARIABLE,name``"
msgstr "``VARIABLE,name``"

msgid "``RSTEP,dr\\\\`` ``ASTEP,da``"
msgstr "``RSTEP,dr\\\\`` ``ASTEP,da``"

msgid "``VARSTEP,varname=value,…``"
msgstr "``VARSTEP,varname=value,…``"

msgid ""
"``ACTIVE,variables\\\\`` If this card is present, all variables which are "
"not specified are inactive. Alternatively,"
msgstr "``ACTIVE,variables\\\\`` 若存在此卡片，则所有未指定的变量均为非活动变量。或者，"

